    "updated_at": "2026-11-22T11:28:07Z",
    "body": "The issue requires a new dependency from camcraft-gpu to camcraft-sim.\nPR #3363 provides camcraft-gpu. Its manifest has no camcraft-sim dependency.\nThe worker instructions forbid changes to Cargo.toml dependencies in Step 6.\nThe worker stopped before the claim because these requirements conflict.\nNo code changed. No tests ran. No claim was made.\nThe expected overlap is PR #3363 in crates/gpu/Cargo.toml, crates/gpu/src/lib.rs, and Cargo.lock.\nThe worker can stack on that PR when the dependency change is allowed.\n",
